<title>INDIA: INDIA'S UTI MONEY MARKET FUND NAV 10.2997 RUPEES.</title>
<headline>INDIA'S UTI MONEY MARKET FUND NAV 10.2997 RUPEES.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's Unit Trust of India (UTI) said on Monday the net asset value of its money market mutual fund was 10.2997 rupees on Aug 12.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22 265 9000</p>
